description=Manually connect one ISA power bank to a Live Wire grid for shared solar generation, battery storage and load settlement. Single-player, LiveWire 1.7.2, 2.0.0–2.0.3 or 2.1.0–2.1.6, 2.1.8 or 2.2.0 with ISA 1.2.15–1.2.16. LiveWire 2.1.4–2.1.6, 2.1.8 and 2.2.0 also accepts ISA batteries in LiveWire power banks. LiveWire Extended is unsupported.
descriptionzh=将一台 ISA 电池柜手动接入 Live Wire 电网，共享光伏发电、储电和负载结算。支持单人模式、LiveWire 1.7.2、2.0.0–2.0.3 或 2.1.0–2.1.6、2.1.8 或 2.2.0 与 ISA 1.2.15–1.2.16。LiveWire 2.1.4–2.1.6、2.1.8 和 2.2.0 的电池组也可直接使用 ISA 电池。暂不支持 LiveWire Extended。
